	"notice": "Uses the TT-303 V1/InstaDJ 2.0 note implementation. Connect MIDI OUT through an interface; V1 requires its DIN-8 MIDI splitter for output. Set the MIDI output channel on the hardware (V1 supports 1-10). An interface port usually has its own name, so select this profile manually for DIN connections. Accent is encoded in note velocity. Sound knobs do not transmit MIDI CC; slide is not a pitch-bend control. Virtual keys start at note 48.",
